 "text": "Fee Structure\nOfficial Fee Structure – Fall 2026 Admissions\nAmounts shown are per student, per semester (PKR). Figures sourced from the official AWKUM Fee Structure — Fall 2026.\n\n[Embedded document: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zC3DGZuA0GpOGhsWVls4PpNZeR5C8_Rx/view]\n\nMaster Programs MS/MPhil/PhD Fee Structure\n\n[Embedded document: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zC3DGZuA0GpOGhsWVls4PpNZeR5C8_Rx/view]\n\n1\nNotifications From Director Admissions & Financial Aid Regarding “Sibling Policy and Late Fee Fine” (https://news.awkum.edu.pk/2019/07/notifications-from-director-admissions.html)\n\nFee Structure for Two-Year Online Associate Degree\n\n[Embedded document: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Emxp_yvJK8Enb42JZvdqqPpeq4jSal0d/view]\n\nMSc, MA and MCS Degree Programmes (Open Category) Fee Structure\n\n[Embedded document: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QkJvW0FAEYe64GFz3TSLI1KwNa9UfZ7F/view]\n\nPrivate Programs Fee Structure\n\nS.No | Head Name | Amount\n01. | BA Part-I Fee | 8130/-\n02. | BA Part-II Fee | 6330/-\n03. | BA One Paper Fee | 2250/-\n04. | BA Two Papers Fee | 2850/-\n05. | MA Previous Fee | 7930/-\n06. | MA One Paper Fee | 2550/-\n07. | MA Two Papers Fee | 3050/-\n08. | MA Final Fee | 9800/-\n09. | MA Final Three Papers Fee | 4250/-\n10. | Viva Voce Fee | 2550/-\n11. | DMC Fee | 1050/-\n12. | Re-totaling Fee | 1250/-\n13. | Correction Fee | 500/-\n14. | NOC Fee | 1050/-\n\nBank Slips\n\nBank Slips & Account Numbers\nFor Admissions (https://awkum.edu.pk/admissions/fee-structure/Downloads/bank-slips/admissions.jpg)\nFor Examination (https://awkum.edu.pk/admissions/fee-structure/Downloads/bank-slips/examination.jpg)\nFor Provost (https://awkum.edu.pk/admissions/fee-structure/Downloads/bank-slips/provost.jpg)\nFor Transport (https://awkum.edu.pk/admissions/fee-structure/Downloads/bank-slips/transport.jpg)",
